I found no `tools/*.mjs` product-role item to flag; reviewed tool candidates were witnesses, test helpers, or workflow automation. ''UNSURE:'' this is a static caller audit, so reflective/dynamic wiring could evade text search; I did not classify every export symbol individually across the very large mesh and node barrels.

''Ten strongest founding-gap signals:'' the first ten ranked entries above, especially recovery readmit, the missing renewal writer, `rollEnrolments`, the `freshBase` provider, and the disconnected tier/secrets gate.

